WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:04,690
Dear baby, why are you here if you don't sleep at night?

2
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:07,320
I'm here

3
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,640
Dad thinks there might be a rat in the store recently

4
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:13,640
I came down specifically to catch rats, but I didn’t expect to catch a small dinosaur.

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:17,490
preferably

6
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:26,750
Why did you come back just now?

7
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:31,160
Talking about cooperation with Beigang, just finished

8
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,960
Where did this meat come from?

9
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:35,280
Given by a friend

10
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:38,340
I have seen all kinds of gifts over the years

11
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,340
The one who delivers pork is still the first one

12
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:41,690
Haven't eaten yet?
